00:09:30.621 --> 00:09:31.837
- Well you're a pretty bad guy.

00:09:31.837 --> 00:09:33.030
(audience laughs)

00:09:33.030 --> 00:09:33.863
I'm just kidding.

00:09:33.863 --> 00:09:37.191
- From people who've said
that I'm taking money by

00:09:37.191 --> 00:09:38.736
CreativeLive even giving away

00:09:38.736 --> 00:09:41.260
three or four billion
minutes of free education.

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:42.253
And

00:09:42.253 --> 00:09:44.132
- The internet has given away way more.

00:09:44.132 --> 00:09:45.957
- Yes, for sure.
- This is like

00:09:45.957 --> 00:09:49.013
I don't understand what
people are debating.

00:09:49.013 --> 00:09:51.133
Information has been commoditized.

00:09:51.133 --> 00:09:52.358
You have to wrap your head around it.

00:09:52.358 --> 00:09:53.191
- Yeah.

00:09:53.191 --> 00:09:54.024
- That's just what,

00:09:54.024 --> 00:09:56.421
you're more than welcome
to live in your own head,

00:09:56.421 --> 00:09:57.733
and create excuses.

00:09:57.733 --> 00:09:59.621
The problem is, nobody gives a fuck.

00:09:59.621 --> 00:10:03.144
Let me say something that
might be a huge unlock.

00:10:03.144 --> 00:10:05.591
99 percent of people don't do anything

00:10:05.591 --> 00:10:08.451
about the free information.

00:10:08.451 --> 00:10:10.439
The reason I give away all my best stuff

00:10:10.439 --> 00:10:12.212
is 'cause nobody does anything about it

00:10:12.212 --> 00:10:14.564
which leaves plenty for me to still do.

00:10:14.564 --> 00:10:15.718
(audience laughs)
- And for the one percent

00:10:15.718 --> 00:10:17.620
that do, those become your new friends.

00:10:17.620 --> 00:10:19.292
Those are your peers, the people you love!

00:10:19.292 --> 00:10:21.500
- Let me tell you one other
thing about those one percent.

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:23.799
They were gonna win anyway.

00:10:23.799 --> 00:10:26.676
You can't stop winners
from winning, my friends.

00:10:26.676 --> 00:10:29.002
And then you can educate
the other 99 percent,

00:10:29.002 --> 00:10:30.591
and get all the admiration

00:10:30.591 --> 00:10:32.277
and leave a wonderful legacy,

00:10:32.277 --> 00:10:34.036
and live a fulfilled life.

00:10:34.036 --> 00:10:35.356
That's the model.

00:10:35.356 --> 00:10:38.084
Be in the yes business.

00:10:38.084 --> 00:10:39.356
Instagram, yes.

00:10:39.356 --> 00:10:40.613
Filters, yes.

00:10:40.613 --> 00:10:41.860
Going live, yes.

00:10:41.860 --> 00:10:43.162
Snapchat, yes.

00:10:43.162 --> 00:10:44.372
TBH, yes.

00:10:44.372 --> 00:10:46.162
Yes, yes, yes.

00:10:46.162 --> 00:10:49.162
Why are you so fancy with your time?

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:52.020
Really, you don't have time for this

00:10:52.020 --> 00:10:53.843
but yet, you have the ambition to get the

00:10:53.843 --> 00:10:57.091
luxuries that come along
with being independent?

00:10:57.091 --> 00:11:00.267
We do not map our actions to our mouths.

00:11:00.267 --> 00:11:02.075
If you have aspirations to win,

00:11:02.075 --> 00:11:04.988
to crush it, to do it the
way you want to do it,

00:11:04.988 --> 00:11:06.684
you need to be in the yes business.

00:11:06.684 --> 00:11:08.067
I at this point have

00:11:08.067 --> 00:11:10.371
achieved enormous things,

00:11:10.371 --> 00:11:12.949
and every day I deploy
humility to download a new app

00:11:12.949 --> 00:11:14.020
and taste it.

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:16.225
Yet, I see creatives always saying no.

00:11:16.225 --> 00:11:17.877
And they come up with
some arbitrary bullshit

00:11:17.877 --> 00:11:19.457
of why it's not pure.

00:11:19.457 --> 00:11:22.495
And then they get run over.

00:11:22.495 --> 00:11:25.788
(audience applauding)
Thank you guys.

00:11:25.788 --> 00:11:28.212
