00:11:39.074 --> 00:11:40.209
One life, baby.

00:11:40.209 --> 00:11:41.367
Just stealin' phones around here?

00:11:41.367 --> 00:11:42.487
- Yeah.
- That's how we do it.

00:11:42.487 --> 00:11:43.320
